 <section class="whyyou">
 <h2>Why you</h2>
-<p>Capital and process discipline do the work here. The reader can map every report from quote, building history and site scope through sample identity, laboratory result, risk class, exception, signature and archive. The scheme requires a quality system, controlled documents, internal review, training records and long report retention. <!-- CHECK: 06-quality-system --> That is familiar systems work applied to a physical service, not an excuse to build an app.</p>
+<p>Capital and process discipline do the work here. The reader can map every report from quote, building history and site scope through sample identity, laboratory result, risk class, exception, signature and archive. The scheme requires a quality system, controlled documents, internal review, procurement controls, replacement arrangements and long report retention. <!-- CHECK: 06-quality-system --> That is familiar systems work applied to a physical service, not an excuse to build an app.</p>
 <p>Polish and Russian can help with CEE-owned contractors, farms, logistics buildings and property operators. English helps with institutional owners. Those languages do not replace the Dutch customer layer. Residents, municipal staff, contractors and certification auditors can all need precise Dutch. A misunderstood access limit or excluded room is not a cosmetic translation error.</p>
