 <p>Partner capture begins before purchase. An overflow partner learns which leads convert and can decline the introduction fee. After acquisition, demolition firms and property managers can demand lower prices because they control job flow. Laboratories can lengthen turnaround or raise sample charges. None of these parties needs to buy the company for its margin to shrink.</p>
