# Essay 6 — source index

Live research re-fetched 2026-09-04. Official sources establish the duty, certification constraints and one named procurement. Employer, vendor and broker pages establish only their advertised terms, offers or conduct. They do not establish market-wide demand, achieved prices or customer retention. Each checked claim has one saved excerpt.

