+12. **Tenders Electronic Daily, “Asbestinventarisatie Huisaansluitingen,” result notice 498508-2024.**
+    URL: https://ted.europa.eu/en/notice/-/detail/498508-2024
+    Accessed: 2026-09-04; official XML also re-fetched from https://ted.europa.eu/en/notice/498508-2024/xml.
