 <p>The founder bottleneck is retaining qualified judgement while refusing to interfere with it. Hiring, route design, debtor control and portfolio sales can be delegated. The technical signature cannot be automated into an owner permission. If customer twenty still calls the seller personally, the acquisition has not transferred.</p>
