+<p>Of the reader's €50,000, the design sends €25,000 to the seller and €25,000 to non-price uses. Every unreceipted number in the table is a design hurdle. Replace the €15,000 reserve with the target's payroll, debtor, tax and laboratory cycle before bidding. Any lender fee outside the stated 1.5%, personal guarantee exposure or mandatory cash top-up counts against the €50,000 ceiling.</p>
